.DS_Store

# --- MultiQC run metadata -------------------------------------------------
# MultiQC writes its report + data dir as `ddi_report.html` / `ddi_report_data/`
# (see `--filename` in modules/local/evaluation). These embed a run timestamp,
# absolute work-dir paths and the MultiQC version, so they differ on every run
# and machine.
**/ddi_report.html
**/ddi_report_data/multiqc.log
**/ddi_report_data/multiqc.parquet
**/ddi_report_data/multiqc_data.json
**/ddi_report_data/multiqc_sources.txt
**/ddi_report_data/multiqc_software_versions.txt
**/ddi_report_data/llms-full.txt
**/multiqc_plots/{svg,pdf,png}/*.{svg,pdf,png}

# --- Trained models and everything derived from them ----------------------
# Not bit-reproducible across runs: the NeuralNetwork search runs with
# n_jobs > 1, and joblib spawns worker *processes* that do not inherit the
# RNG state seeded from `--seed`, so per-candidate scores wobble and a
# different hyperparameter set can win. Hashing these would also break on any
# torch/sklearn bump or a different core count. The snapshot still asserts the
# full output *inventory* via `stable_path`, plus the deterministic extraction
# and graph-topology outputs below.
**/nn_output/**
**/rf_output/**
**/graph_models/**
**/*.pkl
**/model_parameters.json
**/predictions_*.parquet

# Metric/curve/significance exports are computed from those predictions.
**/source_accuracy.json
**/*model_eval_metrics*
**/*model_performance_heatmap*
**/*combined_metrics_table*
**/*combined_pairwise_significance*
**/*combined_pr*
**/*combined_roc*
**/*source_accuracy_by_ddi_source*

pipeline_info/*.{html,json,txt,yml}
